---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | FastLicense"
  description="FastLicense privacy policy. What this static directory collects, the tools it uses, and how to make a privacy request."
>
  <section class="masthead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
      <h1>What this static directory collects.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated October 19, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        FastLicense is a static public directory. There is no account system and no application
        form hosted here. Pages are HTML files.
      </p>
      <p>
        The host, Cloudflare Pages, may keep standard request logs: IP address, user agent, and
        the page requested, to operate the site and stop abuse. We do not run advertising pixels
        on these pages.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you email us, we receive the message you send, including your email address.
      </p>
      <p>
        Links labeled Contact Cornerstone go to
        <a href={SITE.cornerstone.contact}>{SITE.cornerstone.name}</a>. Information you send there
        is handled under that site's privacy terms, not by this directory.
      </p>

      <h2>Tools we use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          We count page views with Cloudflare Web Analytics. It sets no cookies and does not follow
          you across sites. It records the page, referrer, browser type and country, in aggregate.
        </li>
        <li>
          Fonts load from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address and browser details when
          your browser requests them.
        </li>
        <li>Microsoft Clarity is used for anonymous usage analytics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Microsoft Clarity sets first-party cookies (_clck and _clsk) to measure anonymous usage. Cloudflare Web Analytics sets no cookies. No other cookies are set.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices and requests</h2>
      <p>
        To ask what we hold about you, or to have it corrected or deleted, email
        <a href="mailto:privacy@fastlicence.com">privacy@fastlicence.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy by posting a new version on this page and changing the date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:privacy@fastlicence.com">privacy@fastlicence.com</a>.
        You can also use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
